# Peptide scoring pilot outputs. The structures inside are already covered by
# the *.pdb/*.sdf/*.pdbqt rules above, but the JSON provenance records are
# not, and those are the files these stages mainly write. Anchored at the
# repository root so an examples/ or docs/ file of the same name is unaffected.
# These are run outputs, not backups: nothing here is recoverable from Git.
/poses/
/ligands/
/scores/
*.before-group-fix
*.bak
.DS_Store
# Allow intentionally maintained example YAML configurations
!examples/*.yaml

